<p>Nonconsensual intimate images, including qualifying digitally altered or generated images, are prohibited. A depicted individual or authorized representative may submit a removal request through our designated reporting channel. Upon receipt of a valid request, we remove the reported material within 48 hours and make reasonable efforts to identify and remove known identical copies within that period. Send requests to <a href="mailto:support@mydancr.com">support@mydancr.com</a></p>
