<p>MyDancr LLC does not condone dancer to dancer harassment. If you are found to be harassing, bothering, teasing, distracting and/or mocking other models (either as a model or a member), your account may be suspended or terminated. MyDancr LLC supports all dancers and wants everyone to succeed. We expect all dancers to behave maturely and support each other.</p>
